10. Kernel Tick Lifecycle

Kernel Tick

Ingest telemetry

Run rules → PatchSet

Stage patches

Run constraints

Arbitration → ResolutionPlan

Apply fixes

Commit or abort

Project 3D assets

Hash + sign transition

Encrypt + store

This is the deterministic heart of the engine.

